type: software
title: "IRO_agent (Industrial Read-Only Agent)"
abstract: "Evidence-driven, strictly read-only diagnostic AI agent for industrial software systems. It learns a project's operational model, investigates incidents through iterative evidence gathering, and scores its own diagnosis quality using reproducible evaluation datasets."
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
